  "description": "Design pedagogy for radio-frequency oscillator circuits — Colpitts and Hartley LC oscillators tuned for the RF band (100 kHz to GHz), crystal-controlled Pierce references for ppm stability, variable-frequency oscillators for tuning, and the resonant-circuit and antenna fundamentals that couple RF energy into space at the Forrest Mims Communications Projects level.",
